IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MY-BANK_PASSBOOK.
DATA DIVISION.
    WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
   01 Name PIC A(10) value "Vinoth".
   01 Transaction-id PIC X(10) value "x8943g89".   
   01 Debited PIC 9(5)V99 value 35.00.
   01 Original PIC 9(8)V99 value 500.00.
   01 Balance PIC 9(8)V99.
   01 Debited-E PIC Z(5)9.99.
   01 Original-E PIC Z(8)9.99. 
   01 Balance-E PIC Z(8)9.99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "Name:" FUNCTION TRIM(Name).
    DISPLAY "Transaction-ID:" FUNCTION TRIM(Transaction-id).
    MOVE Debited TO Debited-E
    DISPLAY "Debited:" Debited.
    MOVE Original TO Original-E.
    DISPLAY "Original Amount:"FUNCTION TRIM(Original-E).
    COMPUTE Balance = Original - Debited.
    MOVE Balance TO Balance-E.
    DISPLAY "Balance:"FUNCTION TRIM(Balance-E).
STOP RUN.
